          "accept": ["doktorsunuz"]
        },
        {
          "p": "onlar",
          "accept": ["doktorlar", "doktor"]
        }
      ],
      "explain": "The last vowel is o, so the four-way vowel is u: *-um, -sun, -uz, -sunuz*. The third person has no ending, and **they** takes *-lar*."
